<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila's PHIBOR mostly steady ahead of auction.</title>
<headline>Manila's PHIBOR mostly steady ahead of auction.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine interbank offered rates (PHIBOR) were mostly unchanged on Monday ahead of the Treasury bill auction, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;People are waiting for the outcome of the auction,&quot; one trader said. Traders were expecting rates to remain steady at their current levels in this afternoon's auction.</p>
<p>Only the six-month PHIBOR slipped slightly to 10.375 percent from 10.4375 percent.</p>
<p>PHIBOR are average swap rates of 20 contributing banks in the Philippines.  </p>
<p>Average rates quoted by 20 banks were:</p>
<p>			  MAY 13		 MAY 9</p>
<p>    1 W		10  1/8		 10  1/8</p>
<p>    2 W		10  1/16		10  1/16</p>
<p>    1 M		 9 15/16		 9 15/16</p>
<p>    2 M		10  1/16		10  1/16</p>
<p>    3 M		10  1/8		 10  1/8</p>
<p>    6 M		10  3/8		 10  7/16</p>
<p>    12M		10 11/16		10 11/16</p>
<p>    VAL		31-May		  30-May</p>
